VERDICT
========================================================================================================
  ON ITS OWN TERMS (the law as written, g_obs^2 = a0 g_N,tot, a0 = c H_Lambda/Z fixed): the amplitude is
  A = 1.50 +/- 0.00 at Upsilon_d = 0.5 (-25.0 sigma below 1) and A = 1.50 +/- 0.02 with the M/L
  profiled per galaxy (-25.0 sigma); the within-galaxy shape is off at
  9.3 sigma, and the plain framework kernel with NO active mass fits better
  (chi2 difference -5166 +/- 897). DISFAVOURED at ~4 sigma, not killed.
  THE ACTIVE MASS IS NOT NEEDED: free a0 or profiled M/L drive A -> +1.50; in every kernel
  embedding A = 1 is excluded (>= -25.0 sigma, the enclosed reading being the gentlest). The pipeline recovers
  A = 1 when the law is injected, so the null is measured, not an insensitivity.
  Standing consequence: L311's "law of nature" and L312's implications (the halo-baryon correspondence, the
  self-truncation at 790 kpc, the M_b^(+1/4) residual) rest on an active mass SPARC does not want; what SPARC
  wants is the ordinary kernel with a0 ~ 9.31e-11 (M/L profiled; 5.6% grid).

